{"_id":"68a7361b8ec3d8323af176dd","nodeId":"CeAUEN233L4IoFSZtIvvl","roadmapSlug":"game-developer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:07.420Z","description":"# Native\n\nYou don't necessarily have to use tools like Unreal, Unity3d, or Godot to make games. You can also use native languages like C++ or Rust to make games. However, you will have to do a lot of work yourself, and you will have to learn a lot of things that are already done for you in game engines.","resources":[{"type":"roadmap","title":"Visit Dedicated C++ Roadmap","url":"https://roadmap.sh/cpp","_id":"6a7f4a97cb44947debcf83e1"},{"type":"roadmap","title":"Visit Dedicated Rust Roadmap","url":"https://roadmap.sh/rust","_id":"6a7f4a97cb44947debcf83e2"},{"type":"article","title":"Learn Game Development with C++","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/overview/game-development-cpp?view=msvc-170","_id":"6a7f4a97cb44947debcf83e3"},{"type":"article","title":"Building Games with Rust","url":"https://rustmeup.com/building-games-with-rust","_id":"6a7f4a97cb44947debcf83e4"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:04:23.463Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/game-developer/content/CeAUEN233L4IoFSZtIvvl.md"}